{"ts":"2026-08-09T07:21:04.312Z","tool":"execute_code","type":"tool","status":"SUCCESS","ms":1369,"action":"execute","params":{"action":"execute","code":"var overlayTm = default(UnityEngine.Tilemaps.Tilemap);\nforeach (var tm in UnityEngine.Object.FindObjectsByType<UnityEngine.Tilemaps.Tilemap>(UnityEngine.FindObjectsSortMode.None))\n    if (tm.gameObject.name == \"EnvironmentSpriteTilemap\") overlayTm = tm;\nvar zr = UnityEngine.Object.FindObjectsByType<CavesOfOoo.Rendering.ZoneRenderer>(UnityEngine.FindObjectsSortMode.None);\nvar prop = zr[0].GetType().GetProperty(\"CurrentZone\");\nvar zone = (prop != null ? prop.GetValue(zr[0]) : null) as CavesOfOoo.Core.Zone;\nvar claims = new System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary<string, int>();\nfor (int x = 0; x < CavesOfOoo.Core.Zone.Width; x++)\nfor (int ty = 0; ty < CavesOfOoo.Core.Zone.Height; ty++)\n{\n    var t = overlayTm.GetTile(new UnityEngine.Vector3Int(x, ty, 0));\n    if (t == null) continue;\n    string n = t.name;\n    if (n.StartsWith(\"grass\") || n.StartsWith(\"floor\") || n.StartsWith(\"water\") || n.StartsWith(\"wall\") || n.StartsWith(\"sand\") || n.StartsWith(\"slate\") || n.StartsWith(\"bank\")) continue;\n    claims[n] = claims.TryGetValue(n, out var c) ? c + 1 : 1;\n}\nvar sb = new System.Text.StringBuilder();\nforeach (var kv in claims) sb.Append(kv.Key + \"x\" + kv.Value + \" \");\n// also: any AmbientMotes anchors registered?\nvar motes = UnityEngine.Object.FindObjectsByType<CavesOfOoo.Rendering.AmbientMotesRenderer>(UnityEngine.FindObjectsSortMode.None);\nint anchors = motes.Length > 0 ? motes[0].AnchorCount : -1;\nreturn \"NON-TERRAIN CLAIMS: \" + sb + \" || moteAnchors=\" + anchors;","safety_checks":true,"compiler":"auto"}}
